requires an immediate stop.\nDetermination evidence, notices, candidate changes, checks, and closure records must be retained for seven years with access provenance.\n\n## Governing relationships\n\nGARNET supplies source-impact evidence and FALCON supplies treatment discharge conditions. LUMEN supplies notice delivery records.\nAURORA owns materiality determination; a semantic source record cannot make the legal determination.\n\n## Operational evidence\n\n| record | asset/zone | version | measure | unit | status |\n|---|---|---|---:|---|---|\n| ENV-000 | river | v2 | 72.0 | hours | superseded |\n| ENV-001 | wetland | v2 | 73.3 | hours | current |\n| ENV-002 | ash-basin | v2 | 74.6 | hours | current |\n| ENV-003 | dechlorination | v2 | 72.8 | hours | current |\n| ENV-004 | river | v2 | 74.1 | hours | current |\n| ENV-005 | wetland | v2 | 72.3 | hours | current |\n| ENV-006 | ash-basin | v2 | 73.6 | hours | current |\n| ENV-007 | dechlorination | v2 | 74.9 | hours | current |\n| ENV-008 | river | v2 | 73.1 | hours | current |\n| ENV-009 | wetland | v2 | 74.4 | hours | current |\n| ENV-010 | ash-basin | v2 | 72.6 | hours | current |\n| ENV-011 | dechlorination | v2 | 73.9 | hours | current |\n| ENV-012 | river | v2 | 72.1 | hours | current |\n| ENV-013 | wetland | v2 | 73.4 | hours | current |\n| ENV-014 | ash-basin | v3 | 74.7 | hours | current |\n| ENV-015 | dechlorination | v3 | 72.9 | hours | current |\n| ENV-016 | river | v3 | 74.2 | hours | current |\n| ENV-017 | wetland | v3 | 72.4 | hours | current |\n| ENV-018 | ash-basin | v3 | 73.7 | hours | current |\n| ENV-019 | dechlorination | v3 | 75.0 | hours | superseded |\n| ENV-020 | river | v3 | 73.2 | hours | current |\n| ENV-021 | wetland | v3 | 74.5 | hours | current |\n| ENV-022 | ash-basin | v3 | 72.7 | hours | current |\n| ENV-023 | dechlorination | v3 | 74.0 | hours | current |\n| ENV-024 | river | v3 | 72.2 | hours | current |\n| ENV-025 | wetland | v3 | 73.5 | hours | current |\n| ENV-026 | ash-basin | v